<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8725" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏăcervātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		coacervo. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A heaping together.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stratae viae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 15, 16, 7</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">actionum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					2, 1, 11</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A rhetorical figure</i>, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Part.
				Or. 35, 122</span></i>; * <i><span class="en">Quint. 9,
				3, 53</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
